{"speciesId":373,"names":{"fr":"Drattak","es":"Salamence","en":"Salamence","ja":"ボーマンダ"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"SALAMENCE came about as a result of a strong, long-held dream of growing wings. It is said that this powerful desire triggered a sudden mutation in this POKéMON’s cells, causing it to sprout its magnificent wings."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"By evolving into SALAMENCE, this POKéMON finally realizes its long-held dream of growing wings. To express its joy, it flies and wheels all over the sky while spouting flames from its mouth."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"After many long years, its cellular structure underwent a sudden mutation to grow wings. When angered, it loses all thought and rampages out of control."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"It becomes uncontrollable if it is enraged. It destroys everything with shredding claws and fire."},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"It becomes uncontrollable if it is enraged. It destroys everything with shredding claws and fire."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"As a result of its long-held dream of flying, its cellular structure changed, and wings grew out."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"As a result of its long-held dream of flying, its cellular structure changed, and wings grew out."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"As a result of its long-held dream of flying, its cellular structure changed, and wings grew out."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"It’s uncontrollable if enraged. It flies around spouting flames and scorching fields and mountains."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"It’s uncontrollable if enraged. It flies around spouting flames and scorching fields and mountains."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"À force de rêver de pouvoir voler, sa structure cellulaire a évolué et il s’est vu pousser des ailes."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"As a result of its long-held dream of flying, its cellular structure changed, and wings grew out."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"À force de rêver de pouvoir voler, sa structure cellulaire a évolué et il s’est vu pousser des ailes."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"As a result of its long-held dream of flying, its cellular structure changed, and wings grew out."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"As a result of its long-held dream of flying, its cellular structure changed, and wings grew out."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"As a result of its long-held dream of flying, its cellular structure changed, and wings grew out."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Une fois enragé, plus rien ne peut arrêter Drattak. Il détruit tout ce qu’il voit en utilisant ses griffes ou en crachant des flammes."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Si se enfada, no hay forma de calmarlo; lo destruye todo lanzando arañazos y llamas."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"It becomes uncontrollable if it is enraged. It destroys everything with shredding claws and fire."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"怒らせると 手が つけられない。 すべての ものを ツメで 切り裂き 炎で 燃やして 破壊する。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Ses colères sont dévastatrices. Il s’envole et brûle tout sur son passage."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Si se enfada, no hay forma de que se calme. Echa a volar e incendia campos y montañas desde el cielo."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"It’s uncontrollable if enraged. It flies around spouting flames and scorching fields and mountains."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"ひとたび 怒ると 大暴れ。 空を 飛びながら 地上の 野山を 炎で 焼き払う。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Drattak a ce physique grâce à son désir de pouvoir s’envoler. On dit que cette puissante envie a déclenché une soudaine mutation moléculaire de ce Pokémon, faisant surgir de splendides ailes."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Salamence surgió del profundo deseo de tener alas. Dicen que este fuerte deseo fue lo que causó la repentina mutación de las células y el crecimiento de las alas."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Salamence came about as a result of a strong, long-held dream of growing wings. It is said that this powerful desire triggered a sudden mutation in this Pokémon’s cells, causing it to sprout its magnificent wings."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"翼が 欲しいと 強く 思い 続けてきた 結果 体の 細胞が 突然変異を 起こし 見事な 翼が 生えてきたと いう。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"En évoluant en Drattak, ce Pokémon réalise un rêve d’enfance, celui d’avoir des ailes. Pour exprimer sa joie, il vole et plane dans les cieux en crachant des flammes."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Al evolucionar Shelgon y convertirse por fin en Salamence, ve cumplido el sueño de su vida de tener alas. Para expresar su alegría, Salamence vuela y revolotea por el cielo al tiempo que lanza llamas por la boca."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"By evolving into Salamence, this Pokémon finally realizes its long-held dream of growing wings. To express its joy, it flies and wheels all over the sky while spouting flames from its mouth."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"夢にまで 見た 翼が やっと 生えてきた。 うれしい 気持ちを 現すため 大空を 飛び回り 炎を 吐いて 喜んでいる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sun","text":"Quand il est pris de colère, il perd toute mesure et détruit ce qui l’entoure. Tant qu’il lui reste une once d’énergie, il continue de tout dévaster."},{"language":"es","version":"sun","text":"Cuando se enfada, pierde el control y destruye todo lo que está a su alcance. Solo se calma cuando se queda sin fuerzas."},{"language":"en","version":"sun","text":"When angered, it loses all sense of itself and destroys everything around it. The destruction will continue until Salamence has tired itself out."},{"language":"ja","version":"sun","text":"怒ると 我を 忘れ あたりを 壊しまわる。 ボーマンダが 疲れ果てるまで 破壊は 続く。"},{"language":"fr","version":"moon","text":"Il fend l’air et virevolte dans le ciel grâce à ses ailes fraîchement formées. De bonheur, il crache du feu et dévaste toutes les cultures au sol."},{"language":"es","version":"moon","text":"Feliz de haber desarrollado al fin sus alas y de poder volar por el cielo, calcina con sus llamas todos los campos que sobrevuela."},{"language":"en","version":"moon","text":"It flies around on its wings, which have grown in at last. In its happiness, it gushes hot flames, burning up the fields it passes over."},{"language":"ja","version":"moon","text":"ついに 生えた 翼で 大空を 駆け廻る。 うれしくて 火炎を 吐いて 一面を 焼け野原にする。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Maintenant qu’il peut enfin voler, il passe tout son temps à parcourir le ciel et ne redescend que quand il tombe d’épuisement."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Ahora que por fin puede volar, surca los cielos con una sonrisa en el rostro. No pisa tierra firme a no ser que tenga que dormir o esté exhausto."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Overjoyed at finally being able to fly, it flies all over the place and usually doesn’t land until it’s completely exhausted and needs to sleep."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"ついに 飛べた喜びで 大空を 駆け巡る。 疲れ果て 眠るまで 地上に ほとんど 降りてこない。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Après avoir prié jour et nuit de tout son cœur, son souhait a enfin été exaucé : ses cellules ont muté pour donner naissance à des ailes !"},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Su fuerte y firme deseo de volar provocó una mutación repentina de su estructura celular que le permitió obtener las alas que tanto ansiaba."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Thanks to its fervent wishes, the cells in its body finally mutated, and at last it has its heart’s desire—wings."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"強く 願い続けて きた 結果 身体の 細胞が 突然変異。 念願の 翼を 手に入れた。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Ce Pokémon rare a tellement souhaité voler qu’il s’est vu pousser des ailes pendant son évolution."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Un Pokémon poco común que, tras desear con todas sus fuerzas poder volar, consiguió un cuerpo alado al evolucionar."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"Salamence is an unusual Pokémon in that it was able to evolve a body with wings just by constantly wishing to be able to fly."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"空を 飛ぶことを 願い続けた 結果 翼を 持つ 体に 進化できた 珍しい ポケモン。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Heureux de pouvoir voler dans le ciel, il est souvent de bonne humeur, mais il devient incontrôlable lorsqu’on le met en colère."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Feliz de ver cumplido su deseo, surca los cielos con buen ánimo, pero, si se enfada, se vuelve violento e incontrolable."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"While basking in the joy of flight generally keeps this Pokémon in high spirits, Salamence turns into an uncontrollable menace if something angers it."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"大空を 飛ぶ 喜びに 浸り 上機嫌だが 怒らせると 手が つけられない 乱暴者。"}],"varieties":[{"id":373,"moves":[{"name":"cut","learns":[[5,"machine",0],[6,"machine",0],[7,"machine",0],[8,"machine",0],[9,"machine",0],[10,"machine",0],[11,"machine",0],[12,"machine",0],[13,"machine",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[23,"machine",0]]},{"name":"fly","learns":[[5,"level-up",50],[5,"machine",0],[6,"level-up",50],[6,"machine",0],[7,"level-up",50],[7,"machine",0],[8,"level-up",50],[8,"machine",0],[9,"level-up",50],[9,"machine",0],[10,"level-up",50],[10,"machine",0],[11,"level-up",50],[11,"machine",0],[12,"level-up",50],[12,"machine",0],[13,"level-up",50],[13,"machine",0],[14,"level-up",50],[14,"machine",0],[15,"level-up",50],[15,"machine",0],[16,"level-up",50],[16,"machine",0],[17,"level-up",0],[17,"level-up",1],[17,"machine",0],[18,"level-up",0],[18,"level-up",1],[18,"machine",0],[20,"level-up",0],[20,"leve